						<r3d:remarks>RADAR4Memory is based on the established data repository RADAR Cloud, which is operated by FIZ Karlsruhe - Leibniz Institute for Information Infrastructure (https://www.re3data.org/repository/r3d100012330). It was developed as part of FIZ Karlsruhe&#039;s participation in the consortium for the the historically working humanities NFDI4Memory (funded by the German Research Foundation (DFG) - 501609550) within the National Research Data Infrastructure (NFDI). RADAR4Memory complements the existing portfolio of repositories for research data on the field of historical humanities and is ideally suited for cross-disciplinary data or datasets with a variety of different data formats.</r3d:remarks>
